--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package ships the open-source schema, reference client, and Merkle-anchor
primitives for the Hash-anchored Evidence Stream (HAES). HAES is a
tamper-evident append-only ledger for AI-artifact transparency under EU
Regulation 2024/1689 (the EU AI Act) Article 50, which becomes enforceable
on 2026-08-02.

The package has zero runtime dependencies. It relies only on the Node 22+
standard library (`node:crypto` for SHA-256 and Ed25519) and ships an
RFC 8785 (JCS) canonicalization implementation, a Crockford-base32
ULID-style identifier helper, and a binary SHA-256 Merkle tree.

